error[DS0112]: unclosed `(`
  --> query:1:9
  |
1 | let x = (from T | where a
  |         ^ this `(` is never closed
2 | from U | take 1
  | ---- expected `)` before this
  |
  = help: add `)` where the bracketed part ends
